  "text": {
    "en": {
      "text": "While at Full HP, scoring a Weapon Kill or not taking damage for <pve 4.5 /> <pvp [15] /> seconds starts generating <pve 6.6 /> <pvp [1.1] /> <void Void Overshield /> HP per second until you take damage again or until reaching 45 <void Overshield /> HP.\n\nGrants the following while any form of overshield is active:\n• 25 Stability\n• 25 Handling\n• 5% Decreased Accuracy Cone Size\n• 15% increased weapon damage against PvE Combatants (20% for Heat weapons). Damage increase stacks with everything.\n\nWhile any overshield is active, scoring a kill prepares 'Hasty Escape'.\n\nHasty Escape grants the following for 5 seconds once your Overshield is depleted:\n• 50 Mobility\n• 2 meters extended Slide Distance (6.5<arrow/>8.5)\n• Faster Movement Acceleration\n",
      "updatedAt": "2026-11-20T00:05:24.708Z",
