  "bungieSnapshot": {
    "description": "After landing a final blow while at full health, or when out of combat for an extended duration, your shields will slowly recharge into an overshield. \n\nWhen you have an overshield, your weapons gain increased accuracy, stability, handling, and damage against combatants, and final blows will grant a short period of increased mobility once the overshield is depleted.",
